    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Firestone: A casual idle game that plays itself (mostly)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You know the feeling. You want to play something, but not learn a whole new system, grind endlessly, or fight 8-year-olds on a leaderboard. You just want a game that\u2019s fun, satisfying, and doesn\u2019t come with a 40-minute tutorial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Firestone is a laid-back, casual idle game and hero collector where you build a team and progress automatically. Even while you\u2019re doing something else. No pressure. Just progress, loot, and occasionally see dragons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect for fans of idle, AFK, and incremental games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1013320/extras/72bd3eac846cd3ecd83e3a2b7467361b.avif?t=1754400400\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Build a team, then let them do their thing (AFK Progress!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your squad fights automatically. Spells fly, swords swing, enemies explode - all while you sip your coffee. Log in, collect rewards, level up your heroes, maybe swap in a better wizard. Then get on with your day. Progress never stops - even when you\u2019re AFK.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1013320/extras/86f4e259fa2da747c1f1a07b6b0abb48.avif?t=1754400400\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddda A World That Doesn\u2019t Ask Much of You</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From frozen peaks to pirate hideouts, the world of Alandria is packed with fancy graphics. No lore dumps, no confusing side quests. Just a colorful map that you unlock as your team grows. Set some timers and come back to claim rewards - no grind required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1013320/extras/82a7c303063df4c744a8ac11fd8f810c.avif?t=1754400400\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca1 Always Something to Unlock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cool heroes, shiny gear, and cute pets - Firestone has plenty to collect. But it\u2019s never overwhelming. New systems unlock gradually, and upgrades come at a satisfying rhythm. Collect, upgrade, and evolve your squad at your own pace - whether you\u2019re an idler, a clicker, or both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83e\udd1d\u200d\ud83e\uddd1 Stay Solo or Join the Crowd</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join a guild for some extra rewards and light chat. Or skip it entirely. Firestone\u2019s multiplayer is as chill as the game itself, with no pressure to keep up or compete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect For:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 People who play while watching something else</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Casual players who want low-effort progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Anyone who\u2019s ever said \u201cone more level\u201d at midnight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Players who miss when games were just\u2026 fun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Fans of idle, clicker, incremental, or AFK games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Firestone doesn\u2019t want your whole weekend. Just a few good minutes - and progress while you\u2019re away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boot it up, collect your loot, and let your heroes handle the rest.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Firestone: A casual idle game that plays itself (mostly)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You know the feeling. You want to play something, but not learn a whole new system, grind endlessly, or fight 8-year-olds on a leaderboard. You just want a game that\u2019s fun, satisfying, and doesn\u2019t come with a 40-minute tutorial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Firestone is a laid-back, casual idle game and hero collector where you build a team and progress automatically. Even while you\u2019re doing something else. No pressure. Just progress, loot, and occasionally see dragons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect for fans of idle, AFK, and incremental games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1013320/extras/72bd3eac846cd3ecd83e3a2b7467361b.avif?t=1754400400\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Build a team, then let them do their thing (AFK Progress!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your squad fights automatically. Spells fly, swords swing, enemies explode - all while you sip your coffee. Log in, collect rewards, level up your heroes, maybe swap in a better wizard. Then get on with your day. Progress never stops - even when you\u2019re AFK.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1013320/extras/86f4e259fa2da747c1f1a07b6b0abb48.avif?t=1754400400\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddda A World That Doesn\u2019t Ask Much of You</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From frozen peaks to pirate hideouts, the world of Alandria is packed with fancy graphics. No lore dumps, no confusing side quests. Just a colorful map that you unlock as your team grows. Set some timers and come back to claim rewards - no grind required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1013320/extras/82a7c303063df4c744a8ac11fd8f810c.avif?t=1754400400\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca1 Always Something to Unlock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cool heroes, shiny gear, and cute pets - Firestone has plenty to collect. But it\u2019s never overwhelming. New systems unlock gradually, and upgrades come at a satisfying rhythm. Collect, upgrade, and evolve your squad at your own pace - whether you\u2019re an idler, a clicker, or both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83e\udd1d\u200d\ud83e\uddd1 Stay Solo or Join the Crowd</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join a guild for some extra rewards and light chat. Or skip it entirely. Firestone\u2019s multiplayer is as chill as the game itself, with no pressure to keep up or compete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect For:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 People who play while watching something else</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Casual players who want low-effort progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Anyone who\u2019s ever said \u201cone more level\u201d at midnight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Players who miss when games were just\u2026 fun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Fans of idle, clicker, incremental, or AFK games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Firestone doesn\u2019t want your whole weekend. Just a few good minutes - and progress while you\u2019re away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boot it up, collect your loot, and let your heroes handle the rest.</p>",
    "short_description": "Chill out, your heroes got this! They\u2019ll fight even when you\u2019re offline. Pop back in for sweet rewards and easy level-ups. Unlock cool gear, &amp; smack down epic bosses. Play idle or clicker - you\u2019ll power up with no stress, just good times!",
